# pstack on Cloud Agents

Project copy lives at `.cursor/skills/pstack/` (entry point `poteto-mode`).
Use that tree when marketplace plugin skills are missing.

If an injected skill `fullPath` starts with `/home/cursor/` and that path
does not exist, open the same suffix under `$HOME` (`/home/ubuntu/...`) or
the project copy. Load skill files with the Read tool, not `cat`/`bash`.
